# Canonical driver-module list for CactOS x86_32 (PLAN-2.0.0 P3.1).
#
# One repository name per line; the "-for-Cact-x86_32" suffix is implied.
# Blank lines and everything after a '#' are ignored.
#
# This file is the single source of truth for which modules are built and
# installed into the LocalRepo lib/ tree as *.cctk: CactBridge's build.py reads
# it (its own directory) and the CactOS-x86_32 integrator reads the same file
# through its -Dbridge path.  Add or remove entries here only — never re-list
# drivers in a build script, so the image cannot silently keep a stale .cctk.
AHCI
NVMe
Virtio-net
Virtio-gpu
Yukon
Intel-HDA
EXT4
FAT32
RT2800USB
USB-storage
Intel-GPU
